00077Br 2                       ; LV_GRID/LV_BOBJ/LV_BNEXT and every O_TYPE are written only by level_init, so
00077Br 2                       ; which objects the walk yields depends on nothing but the bucket rectangle --
00077Br 2                       ; and that is unchanged on 77% of frames on L0 and 95% on L6.  So walk the grid
00077Br 2                       ; only when the rectangle moves, and keep the deduped list to step through
00077Br 2                       ; otherwise.  Order is preserved exactly: it sets the sprite draw order, which
00077Br 2                       ; box stars depend on (see convert.py).
