001134r 2               ; range check: rx > lo && rx < hi && ry > lo2 && ry < hi2 ; X = offset of the limit
001134r 2               ; quad in RNGTAB (limits stored +128 so the test is an unsigned byte compare on r^$80,
001134r 2               ; after checking r fits in -128..127 - anything wider fails every limit anyway).
001134r 2               ; Returns carry set if inside. Clobbers A, X.
